name=Project Zomboid Vitality Project
id=DanTraits
description=Realistic, balanced traits, mostly negative, that add complications to work around: Alcoholic, Brittle, Arthritis, Jinxed, Caffeine Dependent, Migraines, Hemophilia, Anaemic, Major Depressive Disorder, A Really Bad Day, Hallucinations, Brittle Asthma, Gluten Intolerance, Vegetarian, Diabetes Type 1 and Type 2, Heart Condition, Epilepsy, Tinnitus, Lactose Intolerance, Germaphobe, Straight Edge, plus the positive Renaissance Faire Geek, Gym Regular, Iron Stomach, Early Riser, Meal Prepper, Steady Hands, Night Shift, Hollow Legs and Fast Recovery, a reworked Smoker (dependence you can gain and quit, irritability, damaged lungs and a cough, nicotine gum), hangovers and alcohol tolerance, sunburn and dehydration, and Vitality: fresh food, exercise and sleep slowly earn small stat boosts, junk and neglect the reverse, and the conditions above get milder or harsher with it (rescue inhaler, insulin pen, glucose meter, test strips, metformin, iron pills and anticonvulsants items in the loot pool; the airway irritation moodle needs Moodle Framework).
